{"items": [{"topic": "t1", "k": "2 / Treyder", "slide": {"k": "2 / Treyder", "h": "Treyder kim?", "b": "<p><b>Treyder</b> — finans bazarında óz qarjısı menen (yamasa basqa adamlardıń qarjısın basqarıp) sawda alıp barıwshı adam.</p><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Grafikti oqıydı hám analiz isleydi</li><li>Sawdaǵa kiriw hám shıǵıw waqtın anıqlaydı</li><li>Riskti basqaradı — qarjını qorǵaydı</li><li>Óz emociyasın baqlaydı</li></ul>"}, "h": "Treyder kim?"}, {"topic": "t2", "k": "Forex 1", "slide": {"k": "Forex 1", "h": "Forex — valyuta bazarı", "b": "<p><b>Forex</b> (Foreign Exchange) — bir valyutanı ekinshisine almastırıw bazarı. Dúnyadaǵı eń úlken hám eń likvidli bazar: kúnine trillionlaǵan dollar aylanadı.</p><img class=\"ph\" src=\"t1.jpg\"><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Qatnasıwshılar: bankler, kompaniyalar, sayaxatshılar, treyderler</li><li>Háptesine 5 kún, kúnine 24 saat (Sidney, Tokio, London, Nyu-York sessiyaları)</li><li>Baha ózgeriwine tásir etedi: procent stavkaları, inflyaciya, ekonomikalıq jańalıqlar, siyasat</li><li>Treyder valyutalardıń óz-ara bahasınıń ózgerisinen dáramat tabadı</li></ul>"}, "h": "Forex — valyuta bazarı"}, {"topic": "t2", "k": "Metallar 1", "slide": {"k": "Metallar 1", "h": "Metallar bazarı", "b": "<p>Metallar CFD (shártnama) retinde brokerde MT5 arqalı sawdalanadı. Baha dollar menen belgilenedi (bir troy unsiya ushın).</p><img class=\"ph\" src=\"t4.jpg\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>XAU/USD</b><br>Altın — eń tanıqlısı</div><div class=\"box\"><b>XAG/USD</b><br>Gúmis</div><div class=\"box\"><b>XPT/USD, XPD/USD</b><br>Platina, palladiy</div></div><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Bahaǵa tásir etedi: dollar kúshi, inflyaciya, procent stavkaları, siyasiy qáwip, orta bank satıp alıwları</li><li>Altın qáwipli waqıtta \"qáwipsiz pana\" sıpatında alınadı</li><li>Sawda: MT5 → XAUUSD tańlaw → lot belgilew → Buy/Sell → SL hám TP</li></ul>"}, "h": "Metallar bazarı"}, {"topic": "t2", "k": "Aksiyalar 1", "slide": {"k": "Aksiyalar 1", "h": "Aksiyalar bazarı", "b": "<p><b>Aksiya</b> — kompaniyanıń bir bólegine iye bolıw. Kompaniya jaqsı islese, aksiya bahası ósedi, ayırım kompaniyalar dividend tóleydi.</p><img class=\"ph\" src=\"t2.jpg\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Birjalar</b><br>NYSE, NASDAQ (AQSh), LSE (London), Tokio, Gonkong</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Mısallar</b><br>Apple (AAPL), Tesla (TSLA), Microsoft, Nvidia, Amazon</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Indeksler</b><br>S&amp;P 500, NASDAQ 100 — kompaniyalar toparı</div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Haqıyqıy aksiya</b><br>Broker investitsiya schetı arqalı satıp alasań, aksiyaǵa iyesen hám dividend alasań.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>CFD</b><br>MT5 te Buy/Sell, shóplik menen; aksiyaǵa iye bolmaysań.</div></div><ul class=\"pts\"><li>AQSh aksiyaları: Dúysembi–Juma, 9:30–16:00 (Nyu-York waqtı)</li><li>Sawda: broker → aksiya tańlaw (ticker) → dana sanı → Buy → SL</li></ul>"}, "h": "Aksiyalar bazarı"}, {"topic": "t2", "k": "Aksiyalar 2", "slide": {"k": "Aksiyalar 2", "h": "Aksiya menen sawda mısalı", "b": "<p>Aksiyada kólem — <b>dana sanı</b>. Payda = (shıqqan baha − kirgen baha) × dana.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 200\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,150 80,138 130,148 190,115 240,125 300,90 360,100 420,60 460,45\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"138\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"138\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"500\" y2=\"45\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><g class=\"pp\"><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"138\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><circle cx=\"460\" cy=\"45\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/></g><text x=\"86\" y=\"156\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"start\">Buy 200 $</text><text x=\"452\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"end\">210 $</text><g class=\"pp\"><text x=\"260\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">10 $ × 5 aksiya = +50 $</text></g></svg><div class=\"row\"><div><small>Kirgen baha</small><input id=\"a_e\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" value=\"200\" oninput=\"calc2('a')\"></div><div><small>Shıqqan baha</small><input id=\"a_x\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" value=\"210\" oninput=\"calc2('a')\"></div><div><small>Kólem (lot / dana)</small><input id=\"a_l\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" value=\"5\" oninput=\"calc2('a')\"></div><div><small>Kontrakt ólshemi (1 aksiya)</small><input id=\"a_c\" type=\"number\" step=\"any\" value=\"1\" oninput=\"calc2('a')\"></div><div><small>Baǵıt</small><select id=\"a_d\" onchange=\"calc2('a')\"><option value=\"buy\">Buy</option><option value=\"sell\">Sell</option></select></div></div><div id=\"a_o\"></div><img onload=\"calc2('a')\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\"><div class=\"note\">Esabatlar, jańalıqlar, dividend kúnleri aksiya bahasın kúshli ózgertedi. Bir aksiyaǵa pútkil kapitaldı salma.</div>"}, "h": "Aksiya menen sawda mısalı"}, {"topic": "t3", "k": "2 / Wazıypa", "slide": {"k": "2 / Wazıypa", "h": "Broker ne isleydi?", "b": "<ul class=\"pts\"><li>Sawda platformasın beredi (mısalı MT5)</li><li>Buyrıqlarıńdı birjaǵa jetkeredi</li><li>Schet ashıp, qarjıńdı saqlaydı</li><li>Pul qoyıw hám shıǵarıwdı támiyinleydi</li><li>Leverage (shóplik) usınıs etedi</li></ul>"}, "h": "Broker ne isleydi?"}, {"topic": "t3", "k": "4 / Tańlaw", "slide": {"k": "4 / Tańlaw", "h": "Qanday broker isenimli?", "b": "<ul class=\"pts\"><li>Licenziyası bar (qadaǵalaw organı)</li><li>Pul shıǵarıw tez hám qıyınsız</li><li>Spred hám komissiyası kishi</li><li>MT5 platformasın qollap-quwatlaydı</li><li>Óz tilińizde járdem xızmeti bar</li></ul><div class=\"note\">Brokerdi tańlaw hám registratsiya — kursımızdıń keyingi temasında tolıq kórsetiledi.</div>"}, "h": "Qanday broker isenimli?"}, {"topic": "t4", "k": "Juwmaq", "slide": {"k": "Juwmaq", "h": "Shamlar menen islew qaǵıydaları", "b": "<ul class=\"pts\"><li>Bir sham jetkiliksiz — trend hám zona menen birge qara</li><li>Sham jabılǵanın kút, aldınan kirme</li><li>Hár waqt Stop Loss qoy</li><li>Úlken taymfreymlerde (H1, H4, D1) signal isenimlirek</li></ul><div class=\"note\">Hesh bir sham 100% nátiyje bermeydi. Risk tek úlken emes bólegin alsın.</div>"}, "h": "Shamlar menen islew qaǵıydaları"}, {"topic": "t6", "k": "5 / Paydalanıw", "slide": {"k": "5 / Paydalanıw", "h": "Trend liniya menen sawda", "b": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 200\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,170 110,145 210,115 310,85 345,105 380,125 430,62 480,150\"/><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"440\" y2=\"46\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Buzıw</text><text x=\"430\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Retest</text></svg><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Sekiriw (Bounce)</b><br>Baha liniyaǵa tiyip, trend jaqqa qaytadı. Ósiwde — Buy, túsiwde — Sell.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Buzıw (Break)</b><br>Baha liniyanı jabılıwı menen kesip ótse, trend ózgeriwi múmkin.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Retest</b><br>Buzılǵan liniyaǵa baha qaytıp, qarama-qarsı jaqtan tiyedi. Qáwipsizirek kiriw noqatı.</div></div><div class=\"note\">Liniya — jol kórsetkish, kepillik emes. Stop Loss hám risk basqarıwdı umıtpań.</div>"}, "h": "Trend liniya menen sawda"}, {"topic": "t7", "k": "7 / Shóplik", "slide": {"k": "7 / Shóplik", "h": "Leverage (shóplik)", "b": "<p><b>Leverage 1:100</b> — 1000 $ menen 100 000 $ lıq poziciyanı basqarıw múmkinshiligi.</p><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Shóplik tek <b>kólemdi</b> arttıradı, qáwipti emes — qáwipti lot hám SL belgileydi</li><li>Úlken shóplik + úlken lot = depozit tez jutıladı (Margin Call)</li><li>Baslawshılarǵa tómen lot menen baslaw qáwipsizirek</li></ul><div class=\"note\">Kishi depozitte \"tez baylıq\" ushın úlken lot salıw — eń kóp tarqalǵan qáte.</div>"}, "h": "Leverage (shóplik)"}, {"topic": "t7", "k": "Juwmaq", "slide": {"k": "Juwmaq", "h": "Sawdadan aldın tekseriw dizimi", "b": "<ul class=\"pts\"><li>Risk depozittiń 1–2% ınan aspaydı</li><li>Stop Loss texnikalıq jerde, aldınan belgilengen</li><li>RR keminde 1:2</li><li>Lot ólshemi formula menen esaplanǵan</li><li>Kúnlik zıyan limiti jetpegen</li><li>Sezimge emes, josparǵa súyenip atırman</li></ul><div class=\"note\">Bul sabaq oqıw ushın. Finanslıq keńes emes: sawdada qarjıńdı joǵaltıw múmkin.</div>"}, "h": "Sawdadan aldın tekseriw dizimi"}, {"topic": "t9", "k": "1 / Ne", "slide": {"k": "1 / Ne", "h": "Fundamental analiz degenimiz ne?", "b": "<p><b>Fundamental analiz</b> — bahanıń <b>sebebin</b> úyreniw: mámleket ekonomikası, procent stavkası, inflyaciya, jumıs orınları, kompaniya dáramatı h.t.b. arqalı aktivtiń haqıyqıy qunın bahalaw.</p><div class=\"tw\"><table><tr><th></th><th>Texnikalıq analiz</th><th>Fundamental analiz</th></tr><tr><td><b>Ne qaraydı</b></td><td>Grafik, baha, indikator</td><td>Ekonomika, jańalıq, esabatlar</td></tr><tr><td><b>Soraw</b></td><td>Baha qayerge baradı?</td><td>Baha nege ózgeredi?</td></tr><tr><td><b>Waqıt</b></td><td>Qısqa hám orta</td><td>Orta hám uzaq (jańalıqta qısqa da)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Qural</b></td><td>Shamlar, zonalar, indikator</td><td>Ekonomikalıq kalendar, orta bank sheshimleri</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"note\">Eń jaqsı nátiyje ekewin birge qollanǵanda: fundamental — baǵıtı, texnikalıq — kiriw waqtı.</div>"}, "h": "Fundamental analiz degenimiz ne?"}, {"topic": "t9", "k": "2 / Qalay isleydi", "slide": {"k": "2 / Qalay isleydi", "h": "Bahaǵa ne tásir etedi?", "b": "<p>Valyutada eń tiykarǵı shınjır:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 200\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"200\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><g font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"60\" width=\"110\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"65\" y=\"85\" fill=\"currentColor\">Inflyaciya</text><text x=\"65\" y=\"105\" fill=\"currentColor\">joqarı</text><rect x=\"145\" y=\"60\" width=\"110\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"85\" fill=\"currentColor\">Orta bank</text><text x=\"200\" y=\"105\" fill=\"currentColor\">stavkanı kóteredi</text><rect x=\"280\" y=\"60\" width=\"110\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"335\" y=\"85\" fill=\"currentColor\">Valyutaǵa</text><text x=\"335\" y=\"105\" fill=\"currentColor\">talap artadı</text><rect x=\"415\" y=\"60\" width=\"95\" height=\"60\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"462\" y=\"95\" fill=\"#111\">Valyuta ▲</text><path class=\"ln\" d=\"M122 90H143M257 90H278M392 90H413\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/></g></svg><p>Joqarı procent stavkası kapitaldı tartadı, sonıń ushın valyuta kóbinese bekkemlesedi. Stavka tússe, kerisinshe.</p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Valyuta</b><br>Procent stavkası, inflyaciya, ekonomika ósimi</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Altın</b><br>Dollar, procent, inflyaciya, siyasiy qáwip</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Aksiya</b><br>Kompaniya dáramatı, ekonomika</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Kripto</b><br>Nızamlar, institucional qızıǵıw, ulıwma kayıf</div></div>"}, "h": "Bahaǵa ne tásir etedi?"}, {"topic": "t9", "k": "4 / Jańalıqlar", "slide": {"k": "4 / Jańalıqlar", "h": "Tiykarǵı jańalıqlar hám olar ne bildiredi", "b": "<div class=\"tw\"><table><tr><th>Jańalıq</th><th>Ne</th><th>Qansha tez-tez</th><th>Tásiri</th></tr><tr><td><b>Procent stavkası (FOMC, ECB, BoE, BoJ)</b></td><td>Orta bank stavka sheshimi</td><td>Jılına shama menen 8 ret</td><td>Eń kúshli</td></tr><tr><td><b>NFP (Non-Farm Payrolls)</b></td><td>AQShta jańa jumıs orınları</td><td>Ayına 1 ret, ádetde birinshi Juma</td><td>Júdá kúshli</td></tr><tr><td><b>CPI</b></td><td>Inflyaciya (baha ósimi)</td><td>Ayına 1 ret</td><td>Júdá kúshli</td></tr><tr><td><b>Orta bank basshısı sózi</b></td><td>Pressa konferenciya, sóylew</td><td>Sheshim kúnleri hám ayırım kúnler</td><td>Kúshli, kóbinese kútilmegen</td></tr><tr><td><b>GDP (JIÓ)</b></td><td>Ekonomika ósimi</td><td>Kvartalına 1 ret</td><td>Ortasha-kúshli</td></tr><tr><td><b>PMI / ISM</b></td><td>Ekonomikalıq aktivlik kórsetkishi</td><td>Ayına 1 ret</td><td>Ortasha</td></tr><tr><td><b>Retail Sales</b></td><td>Bólshek sawda</td><td>Ayına 1 ret</td><td>Ortasha</td></tr><tr><td><b>Unemployment / Jobless Claims</b></td><td>Jumıssızlıq</td><td>Ay / hápte</td><td>Ortasha</td></tr></table></div>"}, "h": "Tiykarǵı jańalıqlar hám olar ne bildiredi"}, {"topic": "t9", "k": "5 / Reyting", "slide": {"k": "5 / Reyting", "h": "Eń áhmiyetli jańalıq qaysı?", "b": "<p>Eń vajnısı — <b>procent stavkası sheshimi hám orta bank basshısınıń sózi</b>, sebebi bul pul bahasın tikkeley belgileydi. Keyin NFP hám CPI. AQSh (USD) jańalıqları tek dollarǵa emes, altınǵa, indekslerge hám kriptoǵa da tásir etedi.</p><div style=\"margin:6px 0\"><small>1. Procent stavkası (FOMC, ECB...)</small><div class=\"bar g\" style=\"margin:2px 0\"><i style=\"width:100%;background:#ef5a5a\"></i></div></div><div style=\"margin:6px 0\"><small>2. NFP (jumıs orınları)</small><div class=\"bar g\" style=\"margin:2px 0\"><i style=\"width:90%;background:#ef5a5a\"></i></div></div><div style=\"margin:6px 0\"><small>3. CPI (inflyaciya)</small><div class=\"bar g\" style=\"margin:2px 0\"><i style=\"width:85%;background:#ef5a5a\"></i></div></div><div style=\"margin:6px 0\"><small>4. Orta bank basshısı sózi</small><div class=\"bar g\" style=\"margin:2px 0\"><i style=\"width:75%;background:#f2b52d\"></i></div></div><div style=\"margin:6px 0\"><small>5. GDP</small><div class=\"bar g\" style=\"margin:2px 0\"><i style=\"width:60%;background:#f2b52d\"></i></div></div><div style=\"margin:6px 0\"><small>6. PMI, Retail Sales</small><div class=\"bar g\" style=\"margin:2px 0\"><i style=\"width:45%;background:#27c485\"></i></div></div><div class=\"note\">Reyting shama menen. Bazar neni \"oraylıq másele\" dep ataytuǵını waqıt boyınsha ózgeredi (kópshilik waqıt inflyaciya yamasa stavka bolıp turadı).</div>"}, "h": "Eń áhmiyetli jańalıq qaysı?"}, {"topic": "t10", "k": "5 / Qarama-qarsılıq", "slide": {"k": "5 / Qarama-qarsılıq", "h": "Taymfreymler kelispese ne islew kerek?", "b": "<p>Kishi taymfreymde ósiw kórinse de, úlkeninde túsiw bolıwı múmkin:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,25 70,60 110,45 170,115 215,80 250,140 300,125 350,175 420,160 490,195\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.9s\"><rect x=\"160\" y=\"68\" width=\"68\" height=\"58\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 4\"/><text x=\"194\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">M15: ósiw!</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.5s\"><text x=\"340\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">D1: túsiw trendi</text></g></svg><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Qáwipli</b><br>M15 da Buy kórip, D1 túsiw trendinde Buy ashıw — kóbinese qısqa ǵana qaytıw bolıp shıǵadı.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Durıs</b><br>Úlken taymfreym baǵıtında (D1 tússe — Sell) kishi taymfreymde kiriw tabıladı.</div></div><div class=\"tw\"><table><tr><th>Jaǵday</th><th>Usınıs</th></tr><tr><td><b>Waqtıń az (jumıs, oqıw)</b></td><td>H4–D1, kúnine 1–2 ret qaraw</td></tr><tr><td><b>Kúnine 2–4 saat waqtıń bar</b></td><td>M15–H1</td></tr><tr><td><b>Baslawshı</b></td><td>H1–D1 den baslaw</td></tr><tr><td><b>Kishi depozit, kóp emociya</b></td><td>úlken taymfreym, kishi lot</td></tr></table></div>"}, "h": "Taymfreymler kelispese ne islew kerek?"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "1 / Sdelka", "slide": {"k": "1 / Bitim", "h": "Bitim (sawda) degenimiz ne?", "b": "<p><b>Bitim</b> — bir sawda: <b>kiriw</b> (Entry) hám <b>shıǵıw</b> (Exit). Eki baǵıtta bolıwı múmkin:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">BUY (Long)</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SELL (Short)</text><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,150 60,140 100,150 140,110 180,90 230,50\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"280,50 320,60 360,50 400,90 440,110 490,150\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.2s\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"140\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry</text><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"50\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"36\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Exit</text><circle cx=\"320\" cy=\"60\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"320\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry</text><circle cx=\"490\" cy=\"150\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"480\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Exit</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2s\"><text x=\"130\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">payda: Exit − Entry</text><text x=\"390\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">payda: Entry − Exit</text></g></svg><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Buy (Long)</b><br>Baha ósedi dep oylap alasań. Baha ósse — payda, tússe — zıyan.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Sell (Short)</b><br>Baha túsedi dep oylap satasań. Baha tússe — payda, ósse — zıyan.</div></div><div class=\"note\">Ashıq bitimde payda/zıyan ózgerip turadı (floating). Bitim jabılǵanda nátiyje qaytpas boladı (fiksaciya).</div>"}, "h": "Sdelka (sawda) degenimiz ne?"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "2 / Buyrıq", "slide": {"k": "2 / Buyrıq", "h": "Buyrıq túrleri: Market hám Pending", "b": "<div class=\"tw\"><table><tr><th>Túri</th><th>Ne</th><th>Qashan paydalanıladı</th><th>MT5 de</th></tr><tr><td><b>Market</b></td><td>Házirgi bahada dárhal ashıladı</td><td>Baha qálegen jerde, tez kiriw kerek</td><td>Buy / Sell (Market Execution)</td></tr><tr><td><b>Pending</b></td><td>Belgili bahada avtomat ashıladı</td><td>Belgili dárejeni kútemiz</td><td>Buy Limit, Sell Limit, Buy Stop, Sell Stop</td></tr></table></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Market</b><br>Tez, biraq baha ushın tańlaw joq. Slippage bolıwı múmkin.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Pending</b><br>Dárejeni aldınan belgileysań, terminalǵa qarap otırıwdıń keregi joq.</div></div><ul class=\"pts\"><li><b>Limit</b> — dárejeden <b>qaytıwdı</b> kútemiz</li><li><b>Stop</b> — dárejeni <b>buzıp ótiwdi</b> kútemiz</li><li>Eki túrge de SL hám TP qosıw múmkin</li></ul>"}, "h": "Buyrıq túrleri: Market hám Pending"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "4 / Stop Loss", "slide": {"k": "4 / Stop Loss", "h": "Stop Loss (SL) degenimiz ne?", "b": "<p><b>Stop Loss</b> — baha qáte jaqqa ketse, bitimdi avtomat jabıwshı buyrıq. Zıyandı aldınan belgilep qoyadı.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><rect class=\"gx\" style=\"animation-delay:0.6s\" x=\"100\" y=\"90\" width=\"130\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(239,90,90,.22)\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,100 60,92 100,90 150,102 200,122 230,130\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" style=\"animation-delay:2s\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"rgba(127,127,127,.7)\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"6 5\" points=\"230,130 300,160 380,185 470,198\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.2s\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"90\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry (Buy)</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.1s\"><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"130\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SL urıldı</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">zıyan = 1R</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.8s\"><text x=\"380\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SL bolmasa zıyan ósip baradı edi</text></g></svg><ul class=\"pts\"><li>SL — hesh qashan uzartpa hám alıp tastama</li><li>SL broker serverinde saqlanadı: kompyuter óshse de isleydi</li><li>Aldın SL qashıqlıǵın anıqla, soń lot ólshemin esapla (Risk basqarıw temasın qara)</li></ul>"}, "h": "Stop Loss (SL) degenimiz ne?"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "5 / SL túrleri", "slide": {"k": "5 / SL túrleri", "h": "Stop Loss túrleri", "b": "<p>Eń kóp qollanılatuǵın 5 túri:</p><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>1) Turaqlı (Fixed)</b><br>Belgili qashıqlıq (mısalı 20 punkt). Ápiwayı, biraq bazar logikasın esapqa almaydı.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>2) Dárejege tiykarlanǵan</b><br>Swing low/high, support/resistance artında. Eń logikalı hám keń tarqalǵan.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>3) Volatillik (ATR)</b><br>1.5–2 × ATR qashıqlıqta. Bazar tebigine say sazlanadı.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>4) Trailing Stop</b><br>Baha payda jaqqa ketkende SL de iyerip baradı, keri qaytpaydı.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>5) Break-even</b><br>Payda belgili dárejege jetkende SL Entry ge kóshiriledi: bitim zıyansız.</div></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"430\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"140\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,175 70,115 110,138 150,100 190,125 230,80 280,105 330,60 400,40\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.1s\"><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"125\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Swing low</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.7s\"><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"80\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"230\" y=\"68\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.2s\"><text x=\"300\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Dárejege tiykarlanǵan SL: swing low astında</text></g></svg>"}, "h": "Stop Loss túrleri"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "6 / Trailing", "slide": {"k": "6 / Trailing", "h": "Trailing Stop (animaciya)", "b": "<p>Baha ósken sayın SL de joqarı kóteriledi hám qulıplanǵan paydanı saqlaydı:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 230\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"230\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,180 60,170 100,150 140,158 180,125 220,132 260,98 300,105 340,72 380,80 420,45 455,70 490,100\"/><path class=\"ln\" style=\"animation-delay:.9s\" d=\"M60 185H140V150H220V118H300V88H380V62H448\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.6s\"><circle cx=\"60\" cy=\"170\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"60\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.5s\"><circle cx=\"448\" cy=\"62\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\"/><text x=\"400\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">SL urıldı — payda qulıplandı</text></g></svg><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Qızıl basqıshlı sızıq — Trailing SL: tek payda jaqqa júredi</li><li>Trend uzaq dawam etse, úlken payda ushın qolaylı</li><li>MT5 te: ashıq bitimge oń tugme → Trailing Stop</li></ul>"}, "h": "Trailing Stop (animaciya)"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "7 / Break-even", "slide": {"k": "7 / Break-even", "h": "Break-even (Entry ge kóshiriw)", "b": "<p>Baha 1R paydaǵa jetkennen soń SL ti Entry ge kóshiremiz. Endi bitim zıyan bermeydi:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><path class=\"ln\" style=\"animation-delay:.6s\" d=\"M100 185H200V150H330\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,170 60,160 100,150 150,130 200,105 250,115 300,140 330,150 400,185\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.2s\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"150\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.7s\"><text x=\"200\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1R payda: SL → Entry</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.5s\"><circle cx=\"330\" cy=\"150\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"134\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">BE de jabıldı: 0 $</text></g></svg><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Artıqmashılıǵı: zıyan qáwpi joq, tınısh isleysiz</li><li>Kemshiligi: baha Entry ge qaytıp, keyin kútilgen jaqqa ketiwi múmkin</li><li>Spred hám komissiyadan 0 $ den biraz tómen nátiyje bolıwı múmkin</li></ul>"}, "h": "Break-even (Entry ge kóshiriw)"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "8 / Take Profit", "slide": {"k": "8 / Take Profit", "h": "Take Profit (TP) degenimiz ne?", "b": "<p><b>Take Profit</b> — baha belgilengen payda dárejesine jetkende bitimdi avtomat jabıwshı buyrıq. Ashkózlikten saqlaydı.</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><rect class=\"gx\" style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\" x=\"60\" y=\"40\" width=\"420\" height=\"80\" fill=\"rgba(39,196,133,.18)\"/><rect class=\"gx\" style=\"animation-delay:0.4s\" x=\"60\" y=\"120\" width=\"420\" height=\"40\" fill=\"rgba(239,90,90,.2)\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"120\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"120\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,140 60,130 100,120 150,132 200,95 250,105 300,60 350,50 400,40\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.2s\"><text x=\"470\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"end\">Entry</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"176\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"end\">SL (−1R)</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"end\">TP1 (+1R)</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"end\">TP2 (+2R)</text></g></svg><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>RR 1:1</b><br>Risk 10 $ — payda 10 $</div><div class=\"box\"><b>RR 1:2</b><br>Risk 10 $ — payda 20 $</div><div class=\"box\"><b>RR 1:3</b><br>Risk 10 $ — payda 30 $</div></div>"}, "h": "Take Profit (TP) degenimiz ne?"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "9 / TP túrleri", "slide": {"k": "9 / TP túrleri", "h": "Take Profit túrleri", "b": "<div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>1) Turaqlı RR</b><br>SL dan 2–3 ese uzaqlıqta (1:2, 1:3). Ápiwayı hám túsinikli.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>2) Dárejege tiykarlanǵan</b><br>Aldındaǵı resistance (Buy) yamasa support (Sell) aldında.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>3) Model boyınsha</b><br>Model biyikligi (tayaq, tóbe–boyın aralıǵı) buzılǵan noqattan salınadı.</div><div class=\"box\"><b>4) Bólekshe (Partial)</b><br>TP1, TP2, TP3: bitimdi bólip jabıw (mısalı 50% / 30% / 20%).</div><div class=\"box\"><b>5) Trailing TP</b><br>Belgili TP joq, trend ketkenshe trailing SL menen uslap turıladı.</div></div><div class=\"note\">Dárejege tiykarlanǵan TP da RR ge qaraw kerek: jaqın dáreje RR 1:1 den tómen bolsa, sawdaǵa kirmew kerek.</div>"}, "h": "Take Profit túrleri"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "10 / Partial TP", "slide": {"k": "10 / Partial TP", "h": "Bólekshe TP (animaciya)", "b": "<p>Baha TP1, TP2, TP3 ke jetkenshe bitim bólip jabıladı, hám TP1 den soń SL Entry ge kóshiriledi:</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"160\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"160\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"185\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"185\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"90\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"480\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,170 60,165 100,160 140,148 170,125 200,135 240,110 270,90 310,100 350,75 380,55 430,60\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.2s\"><circle cx=\"170\" cy=\"125\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"170\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TP1: 50%</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.9s\"><circle cx=\"270\" cy=\"90\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"270\" y=\"79\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TP2: 30%</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.6s\"><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"55\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TP3: 20%</text></g><text x=\"470\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"end\">Entry</text><text x=\"470\" y=\"200\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#ef5a5a\" text-anchor=\"end\">SL</text></svg><div class=\"tw\"><table><tr><th>TP</th><th>Jabıladı</th><th>RR</th><th>Payda (1R = 10 $)</th></tr><tr><td><b>TP1</b></td><td>50%</td><td>1:1</td><td>+5 $</td></tr><tr><td><b>TP2</b></td><td>30%</td><td>1:2</td><td>+6 $</td></tr><tr><td><b>TP3</b></td><td>20%</td><td>1:3</td><td>+6 $</td></tr><tr><td><b>Jámi</b></td><td>100%</td><td>—</td><td>+17 $ (1.7R)</td></tr></table></div>"}, "h": "Bólekshe TP (animaciya)"}, {"topic": "t11", "k": "Juwmaq", "slide": {"k": "Juwmaq", "h": "Tolıq sawda joybarı (animaciya)", "b": "<p>Mısal: EUR/USD Buy 0.1 lot. Entry 1.0800, SL 1.0780 (20 punkt), TP1 1.0820, TP2 1.0860 (60 punkt).</p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 220\"><rect width=\"520\" height=\"220\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(127,127,127,.07)\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"130\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"130\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><path class=\"ln\" style=\"animation-delay:.6s\" d=\"M100 160H180V130H380\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ef5a5a\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"100\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><line x1=\"100\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"380\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#27c485\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"7 5\"/><polyline class=\"ln\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f2b52d\" stroke-width=\"4\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" points=\"20,150 60,140 100,130 140,125 180,100 220,112 260,125 300,95 340,70 380,40\"/><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:0.9s\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"130\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#f2b52d\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f2b52d\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Entry</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:1.5s\"><circle cx=\"180\" cy=\"100\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"88\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"middle\">TP1: 50% jabıldı, SL → Entry</text></g><g class=\"pp\" style=\"animation-delay:2.4s\"><circle cx=\"380\" cy=\"40\" r=\"7\" fill=\"#27c485\"/><text x=\"380\" y=\"28\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#27c485\" text-anchor=\"end\">TP2: +30 $</text></g></svg><ul class=\"pts\"><li>Risk: 20 punkt × 10 $ × 0.1 lot = <b>20 $</b></li><li>TP1 (+20 punkt, 0.05 lot): <b>+10 $</b></li><li>TP2 (+60 punkt, 0.05 lot): <b>+30 $</b></li><li>Jámi: <b>+40 $ = +2R</b> (SL Entry de bolǵanı ushın zıyan joq)</li></ul><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"box\"><b>Bitimnen aldın</b><br>Trend, zona, signal, SL, TP, lot</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Bitim waqtında</b><br>TP1 dan soń SL → Entry</div><div class=\"box\"><b>Bitimnen soń</b><br>Jurnalǵa jaz: sebebi, nátiyjesi</div></div><div class=\"note\">Bul sabaq oqıw ushın, finanslıq keńes emes. Sawdada qarjıńdı joǵaltıw múmkin.</div>"}, "h": "Tolıq sawda joybarı (animaciya)"}]}